{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S03、S06、S07、S11至S13等段落的感受提示偏密，尤其短段里连续按小节出现，容易让人顾着追字而漏听；X的因果叙述也有几处更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的单列交替、重点词加亮和感受按乐段出现，让视线知道先抓哪句话，也减少了同时面对大量文字的负担。它对音乐中的音型、力度、节奏和情绪变化描写得更具体，前后反复出现的旋律与人物心境也更容易连成一条线。不过X的叙述在人物动机和心理因果上更周全，Y有些地方压缩后略微改变了问题重心。整体而言，Y更容易让普通观众边听边理解，也更容易获得细腻的音乐感受。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d450e93a-9588-42a1-a8bd-f358b019cf55", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T000905041749Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:10:33.968462+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "29cc12aa1ce44171e9463ac1feba3ed05130c8c81efa3eff5f0b59f5870951c3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch